Convergence HUD views

The browser modules under modules/convergence and the six original convergence
test suites were copied from ui/netclaw-visual in byrn-baker/netclaw-convergence
at revision f182b8be2eb9588486d9d8e34a67dc3bd31631d6. They retain the source
repository's Apache License, Version 2.0, included in LICENSE. The platform
extraction generalized one HomeView.js comment to omit a deployment's hostnames.

world-regions.js includes Natural Earth 1:110m public-domain country outlines.
The original source attribution is preserved in that file.

Package metadata, documentation and additional package tests were added during
the Convergence platform extraction. Dependencies retain their own licenses.
